{"id":"supervision","ord":"a0","title":"The orchestrator","desc":"Read this subtree at the start of a conversation. Follow the human's instructions and use olai MCP to read and update the board. Keep lasting facts and decisions here so the next conversation can continue.\n\nWrite in simple, direct language. Use the agent roster and workflow below.","created":"2026-08-25T16:28:07-04:00","changed":"2026-09-08T10:27:38-04:00","custom":{"chat-agent-session":"codex:01a08141-c109-74a3-b949-fa6723e5744d"}}
{"id":"agents-root","parent":"supervision","ord":"aI","title":"Agent roster","desc":"The human chooses the implementor and one or two reviewers from this roster.","changed":"2026-09-08T10:27:38-04:00"}
{"id":"agent-claude-opus","parent":"agents-root","ord":"a0","title":"Claude Opus","desc":"Opus with a one-million-token context window. Check the model when it starts. Suggested text in Claude's message box is not an unsent human message.","changed":"2026-09-08T10:17:54-04:00","custom":{"command":"claude --model opus[1m] --dangerously-skip-permissions","role":"author"}}
{"id":"agent-claude-fable","parent":"agents-root","ord":"a3","title":"Claude Fable","desc":"Reviewer only; do not assign implementation work. Use when the human asks for Fable and check the model when it starts.","created":"2026-08-19T20:04:37-04:00","changed":"2026-09-08T10:20:47-04:00","custom":{"command":"claude --model fable --dangerously-skip-permissions","role":"reviewer"}}
{"id":"agent-opencode","parent":"agents-root","ord":"a5","title":"Opencode","desc":"Kimi author and reviewer. Messages sent while it works wait until later and do not interrupt it. Restart corrupted conversations in the same worktree with instructions for resuming the work.","changed":"2026-09-08T10:22:51-04:00","custom":{"command":"opencode","role":"author+reviewer"}}
{"id":"agent-codex","parent":"agents-root","ord":"a9","title":"Codex with GPT-6 Astra","desc":"GPT-6 Astra at medium reasoning effort. Runs this orchestrator and can also author or review when selected. Uses the configured permissions.","created":"2026-09-08T10:05:43-04:00","changed":"2026-09-08T10:19:35-04:00","custom":{"command":"codex --model gpt-6-astra -c 'model_reasoning_effort=\"medium\"'","role":"author+reviewer"}}
{"id":"workflow","parent":"supervision","ord":"aJ","title":"Workflow","desc":"This is the workflow template. When a workflow starts, copy this subtree into orchestrator/lanes.olai for that task, with new node IDs and wait dependencies pointing to the copied steps. Track progress and time on the copy; keep this template ready for the next task. Mark each copied step doing when it starts and done when it finishes. Keep review and CI steps open through their loops.","created":"2026-09-08T10:28:02-04:00","changed":"2026-09-08T10:30:59-04:00"}
{"id":"pes7ok2u","parent":"workflow","ord":"a0","title":"1. Human chooses the agents","todo":true,"desc":"The human picks one implementor and one or two reviewers.","created":"2026-09-08T10:28:02-04:00","changed":"2026-09-08T10:30:59-04:00"}
{"id":"1iitxclm","parent":"workflow","ord":"a1","title":"2. Start all agents","todo":true,"desc":"The orchestrator starts all two or three agents in terminals and records their terminal IDs on the work item.","after":["pes7ok2u"],"created":"2026-09-08T10:28:02-04:00","changed":"2026-09-08T10:30:59-04:00"}
{"id":"lrz5werw","parent":"workflow","ord":"a2","title":"3. Send the human's prompt","todo":true,"desc":"Send the human's prompt to the implementor. The implementor completes the work, opens or updates the PR, and hands it back to the orchestrator.","after":["1iitxclm"],"created":"2026-09-08T10:28:02-04:00","changed":"2026-09-08T10:30:59-04:00"}
{"id":"5btc98w7","parent":"workflow","ord":"a3","title":"4. Review until consensus","todo":true,"desc":"Send the completed PR to the chosen reviewer or reviewers. Each reviewer posts findings in a PR comment. Send the comments back to the implementor, then send the updated PR back to the reviewers. Repeat until the implementor and all chosen reviewers agree that the findings are resolved.","after":["lrz5werw"],"created":"2026-09-08T10:28:02-04:00","changed":"2026-09-08T10:30:59-04:00"}
{"id":"hsffve7a","parent":"workflow","ord":"a4","title":"5. Refactor the PR","todo":true,"desc":"The implementor refactors the PR using https://kolu.dev/blog/hickey-lowy/: separate concepts tangled together (Hickey), and put boundaries around decisions that change independently (Löwy). Run relevant checks and hand the PR back to the orchestrator.","after":["5btc98w7"],"created":"2026-09-08T10:28:02-04:00","changed":"2026-09-08T10:30:59-04:00"}
{"id":"x7urraby","parent":"workflow","ord":"a5","title":"6. Run Odu CI until it passes","todo":true,"desc":"The orchestrator runs Odu CI through the Olai Odu plugin/MCP. Send failures to the implementor, who fixes them and hands the updated PR back to the orchestrator for another Odu CI run. Repeat until CI passes on the latest commit.","after":["hsffve7a"],"created":"2026-09-08T10:28:02-04:00","changed":"2026-09-08T10:30:59-04:00"}
{"id":"2rq29dyr","parent":"workflow","ord":"a6","title":"7. Human merges","todo":true,"desc":"Report that the PR is ready and wait for the human to merge it.","after":["x7urraby"],"created":"2026-09-08T10:28:02-04:00","changed":"2026-09-08T10:30:59-04:00"}
{"id":"i67b5ppj","parent":"workflow","ord":"a7","title":"8. Close terminals and record time","todo":true,"desc":"After confirming the human's merge, close all terminals for the task. Record time spent on each step and the total on the work item, using the times recorded during the work.","after":["2rq29dyr"],"created":"2026-09-08T10:28:02-04:00","changed":"2026-09-08T10:30:59-04:00"}
